WEBVTT

00:00:27.924 --> 00:00:30.489
the people who have
the bull's-eye on their foreheads

00:00:30.513 --> 00:00:32.203
are poor people.

00:00:32.227 --> 00:00:35.304
People got very upset

00:00:35.328 --> 00:00:38.407
when the BP oil spill happened,

00:00:38.431 --> 00:00:39.891
for very good reason.

00:00:39.915 --> 00:00:41.539
People thought, "Oh, my God.

00:00:41.563 --> 00:00:44.339
This is terrible, this oil --
it's in the water.

00:00:44.363 --> 00:00:48.281
It's going to destroy
the living systems there.

00:00:48.305 --> 00:00:49.739
People are going to be hurt.

00:00:49.763 --> 00:00:51.254
This is a terrible thing,

00:00:51.278 --> 00:00:53.613
this oil is going to hurt
the people in the Gulf."

00:00:53.637 --> 00:00:55.707
What people don't think about is:

00:00:55.731 --> 00:00:57.890
What if the oil had made it
safely to shore?

00:00:58.484 --> 00:01:01.175
What if the oil actually got
where it was trying to go?